2 CONT
2 CONT "The cartulary of Liebana includes an undated, but certainly early, document which provides details realting to the descendants of a certain Benedicto and his wife Ellesinda. In addition
2 CONT to a son, they had two daughters, Osicia and Divigria, the latter married to an Aquilo. This couple had, with several others, two sons, Fafila and Diego, who married his first cousin Gulvira, daughter of Osicia, and had a son Pedr
2 CONC o (again, with others)."
2 CONT
2 CONT Posted by Prof. Dr. Francisco Antônio Dória (Francisco Antônio de Moraes Accioli Dória), Brazilian mathematician, philosopher and genealogist. He is member of the Colégio Brasileiro de Genealogia.
