2 CONC  the years of the Lord of 884 CAFOs with Dona Sula and daughter of Count Don Diego Porcelos, who settled at Burgos, and had Nuño Nuñez Rafura child was the father of Mrs. Nuñez Terefa Vella, that CAFOs with Layn Calvo, feugro and 
2 CONC son were the two famofos Iuezes of Caftilla. NOBILITY OF ANDALVZIA For Gonçalo Argote de Molina, Sevilla 1588. Don Alvar Perez de Caftro Capitan most of the border, and fu linage and Weapons. Chap. C.. Pp. 102
