2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT GUTINA Díaz, daughter of [DIEGO Rodríguez "Porcelos" Conde de Castilla & his [first/second] wife ---].  Pérez de Urbel emphasises that there is no proof of Gutina's parentage.  However, it is suggested by her grandson conde Fernan
2 CONC do González confirming donations to San Félix made by conde Diego Rodríguez[93].  Fernando & his wife had [four] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)             GONZALO Fernández de Lara
2 CONT
2 CONT b)             NUÑO Fernández de Amaya
2 CONT
2 CONT c)             [RODRIGO Fernández
2 CONT
2 CONT d)             [FLÁMULA Fernández (-after 24 Nov 929)
