2 CONT From https://rua.ua.es/dspace/bitstream/10045/6786/1/HM_13_11.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT >''The Historia Roderici'' certainly allows us to complete the genealogical information that leads us to consider that of Vivar as another member of a highly relevant count lineage in the history of the Kingdom of León: the Flaíne
2 CONC z, whose memory goes back to the decade of the tenth century when, in 932 according to Ibn Hayyan, a count named '''Flaín''', brother-in-law of the monarch, clashed with the rebels who supported the cause of Alfonso IV.
