2 CONT Rutpert I Count of the Upper Rhine and Wormsgau was born in 689.2 He was the son of Lambert II and Chrotlind.1,2,3,4 Rutpert I Count of the Upper Rhine and Wormsgau was Count in the Upper Rhine and Worms between 722 and 757.3,4 In
2 CONC  730 Rutpert, married Williswint, daughter of Count Adelhelm.1,2,3,4 Rutpert I Count of the Upper Rhine and Wormsgau was created Duke in the Haspengau in 732.4 He died before 764.1,2,3,4 
