2 CONC  Angilæ" [Birstatt] to Lorsch by charter dated 1 Jun 770, signed by "Thurincberti fratris ipsius Cancronis et Heimerici filii sui"[530].  The Chronicon Laureshamense records "Thurincberti fratris ipsius Cancronis" as signatory of 
