2 CONT Urraca Salvadorez de Castilla1
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 981, d. 20 May 1025
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Salvadore Pedro, conde de Castilla1 b. after 962
2 CONT
2 CONT      Urraca Salvadorez de Castilla was born circa 981. She was the daughter of Salvadore Pedro, conde de Castilla.1 Urraca Salvadorez de Castilla married Sancho I "el de los Buenos Fueros", conde de Castilla, son of García I "el d
2 CONC e las Manos Blancas", conde de Castilla and Aba Raimúndez de Ribagorza, in 994; 1st cousins.1,2 Urraca Salvadorez de Castilla died on 20 May 1025.1
2 CONT
