1 NAME Froiloba /Bermúdez/
2 GIVN Froiloba
2 SURN Bermúdez
2 _MARNM Bermúdez
2 NICK Froiliuba Vermudez
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bermudo_N%C3%BA%C3%B1ez
2 CONT
2 CONT Froiloba Bermúdez, the eldest daughter who married before 947 with the Leonese magnate Muño Flaínez. Her filiation is known from a donation from her daughter, Jimena, to the Sahagún monastery in 985 from a town called Saloiro, whi
2 CONC ch says that she inherited it from her grandfather, Bermudo Núñez.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT < [https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Muño_Fla%C3%ADnez Wikipedia] > '''Muño Flaínez''' (fl. c. 943-962),1 also written Munio, documented in the History Roderici as Nuño Flaínez, was Count of León and great-grandfather for the paternal
2 CONC  branch of El Cid, in addition to great-great-grandfather of his wife Jimena Díaz. Son of '''Flaín Éctaz''' (fl. 932),2 3 was born into a family of the Asturian aristocracy. Although his presence at court was scarce, he appears in
2 CONC  the documentation from 943 to 962 making several donations to the monastery of Sahagún and the cathedral of León1 and acquiring several properties, including a village in the valley of Laurenzo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and descent
2 CONT
2 CONT Muño is already married in 947 to Froiloba Bermúdez, daughter of an important Leonese tycoon, the Count of CeaBermudo Núñez, and his wife Countess Argilo.2 4 5 6 Froiloba was the sister of, among others, Jimena Fernández, Queen of
2 CONC  Pamplona for her marriage to King García Sánchez II, as well.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children: 
2 CONT *  Flaín Muñoz, Count.5 7.  Married 1) Justa Fernández de Cea 2) unknown mistress 3) Justa Pepiz 
2 CONT * Velasco, husband of Natalia cognomento "Godo" Braóliz, with succession.7
2 CONT * Jimena,5 wife of Gonzalo Gómez of the lineage of the Banu Mirel, landowners in the Land of Campos.8 7
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Genealogy 
2 CONT < [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20EARLY%20MEDIEVAL.htm#PedroFlainezMBronildeB Medlands] > 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''MUNIO Flaínez''', son of FLAÍN Díaz & his wife --- (-[31 Oct 961/19 Jun 962]).  "Osorio Monniz, Monnio Gudesteiz, Diaco Romaniz, Monnio Flainiz, Veremudus Flainiz" confirmed the charter dated 1 Jan 943 under which King Ramiro I
2 CONC I granted to “Vermudo Nunniz” property confiscated from “Dom Patre”[962].  …  m (before 13 Aug 947) '''FROILOBA Vermúdez''', daughter of VERMUDO Núñez Conde en Cea & his first wife Argila -- . …
2 CONT
2 CONT Munio & his wife had [five] children: 
2 CONT * 1.         [FRUELA Muñoz (-after 1 Mar 973). ..
2 CONT * 2.         FLAÍN Muñoz (-[998/11 Mar 1003]).  … [m firstly ([before 975]) his first cousin, JUSTA Fernández, daughter of conde FERNANDO Vermúdez de Cea [Leon] & his wife condesa Elvira Díaz (before [955]-).  [m firstly ([before 
2 CONC 975]) his first cousin, JUSTA Fernández, daughter of conde FERNANDO Vermúdez de Cea [León] & his wife condesa Elvira Díaz (before [955]-). m [secondly] (before 1 May 987) JUSTA Pépiz, daughter of [983][PEPI Alfonso/PEPI Garvísiz &
2 CONC  his wife ---] (-after 15 Jul 1009). 
2 CONT * 3.         [ANSUR Muñoz (-after 1 Jan 1002).  
2 CONT * 4.         [VELASCO Muñoz (-after 6 Sep 986).
2 CONT * 5.         JIMENA Muñoz (-after 4 Nov 1009). m GONZALO Gómez, son of GÓMEZ Miréllez & his wife --- (-before 8 May 984). 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Ancestros de Jimena Díaz según la genealogía propuesta por la profesora Margarita Torres Sevilla. 
2 CONT ''
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000194714742822&size=large}}
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * Torres Sevilla-Quiñones de León, Margarita Cecilia, "El linaje del Cid", Annals of the University of Alicante. Medieval History. n.º 13 (2000-2002). ISSN 0212-2480, pp. 343-360. < [https://rua.ua.es/dspace/bitstream/10045/6786/1
2 CONC /HM_13_11.pdf PDF] > 
