2 CONT Page 62:
2 CONT
2 CONT 11.   St. LEUTWINUS (LIUTWIN, LIEVIN), d. c.713; founder and monk of Mettlach, then Bishop of Treves 685-704.  His canonical day in 29 Sept.  ENGELBERT 372; RAMSGATE (439).
2 CONT
2 CONT !Availability: The libraries of Ken, Karen, Kristen, Kevin, Brian, Amy, Adam and FAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT == Question: What is the significance of ENGELBERT 372; RAMSGATE (439)?  -kfl
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "Ancestral Roots of Sixty Colonists" by Frederick Lewis Weis.
2 CONT
