2 CONT Page 62:
2 CONT
2 CONT 10.  Count  WARINUS (Guerin, c.626-77; implicated in the assassination 673 of King Childeric II of Austrasian Franks; brother of St. Leger (Leudegar), Bishop of Autun; mar. KUNZA, sister of Bazin, Bishop of Treves (Trier). 
2 CONT
2 CONT !Availability: The libraries of Ken, Karen, Kristen, Kevin, Brian, Amy, Adam and FAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: "Ancestral Roots of Sixty Colonists" by Frederick Lewis Weis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 55 line (50-9):
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.    Count Warinus of uncertain parentage, d. 677 (bro of St. Lèger, d. 677, Bishop of Autun); m. Kunza, sister of Bishop of Trèves.
