2 CONT If it is accepted that he [Diego Laínez de Vivar (ca. 1023-1058)] was El Cid's father, he was married to María, Sancha or Teresa Rodríguez (only the surname of El Cid's mother is known for sure), who was the daughter of the Count 
2 CONC of Oviedo, Rodrigo Álvarez who ruled several estates, including Luna, Torremormojón, Moradillo, Cellorigo and Curiel.3
2 CONT
