2 CONT
2 CONT * Complete name:	'''Rodrigo Díaz''', ''the Champion''
2 CONT * Other titles:	"National Hero"
2 CONT * Birth: c. 1048  Vivar del Cid, Burgos?
2 CONT * Death:	1099 Valencia
2 CONT * Burial: Cathedral of Valencia (1099); Monastery of San Pedro de Cardeña (1102); Burgos Cathedral (1921)
