1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Berthar or Bertachar was a son of Bisinus and Basina. He and his brothers Hermanfrid and Baderic succeeded their father Bisinus to the rule over the Thuringii. Berthar, however, was soon defeated by Hermanfrid in b
2 CONC attle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Berthar had one daughter, Radegund (later canonised), who married the Frankish king Clotaire I.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bertachar
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Berthacharius was samen met zijn broers Baderik en Herminafried koning van de Thüringers. Hij leefde ongeveer tussen 500 en 550 na Christus. Hij was de zoon van de Thüringse koning Bisinus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Zijn zus Radegund was getrouwd met Wacho, koning van de Langobarden.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berthachar
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/THURINGIA.htm#dauMAudouinLombards
