1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT King of Neustria, France from 511. Divorced first wife, strangled 2nd.
2 CONT Clothaire I stuck to Clovis' unfortunate precedent & divided his kingdon
2 CONT between his sons. Note that Chilperic was the son of Ar‚gonde, a concubine
2 CONT rather than a wife, which did not affect his entitlement to a share in the
2 CONT inheritance.
