2 CONC nth was found strangled in bed. Chilperic then married Fredegund again.   Chilperic was assassinated in 584 while hunting at Chelles, near Paris. As Chilperic was dismounting from his horse, a man stepped forward and stabbed him.
2 CONT    Other sources: RC 303; AF; "Women in the Wall" chart.
