1 OCCU was the most important East Frankish general during the reign of Charles the Fat., Conde de Grapfeld, Frankish count in the Grapfeld (Grabfeld) from 819–839., Count of Grabfeld, Unknown GEDCOM info: Greve Unknown GEDCOM info: 0, C
