2 CONT
2 CONT Berswinde was born about 640.   Her parents are not known, but she is placed as a [great] niece of DIDO (-after 673).  Bishop of Poito.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Eticho, Duke of Alsace, son of Leutharius Mayor of the Palace.5,1  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Family 
