2 CONC swindam…filiam sororis sancti Leodegarii, sororem videlicet regina"[15].  The Chronicon Ebersheimense names "Berswindam, filiam sororis Leodegarii episcopi…et Garini comitis Pictavensis, sororem videlicet regina" as the wife of At
2 CONC hicus[16]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eticho/Adalrico & his wife had five children: 
2 CONT *1.         ADALBERT [I] .  A 15th century genealogy included in the cartulary of Honau names "Adelbertum, Battichonem, Hugonem, Hechonem" as the four sons of "Adalrici ducis vel alio nomine Hettichonis"[17].  Duke in Alsace.  He 
2 CONC is named "ducis Adelberti" in the Annales Murbacenses as father of Eberhard[18]. 
2 CONT * 2.         BATTICHO .  A 15th century genealogy included in the cartulary of Honau names "Adelbertum, Battichonem, Hugonem, Hechonem" as the four sons of "Adalrici ducis vel alio nomine Hettichonis"[19].  m -.  
2 CONT * 3.         HUGO [I] .  A 15th century genealogy included in the cartulary of Honau names "Adelbertum, Battichonem, Hugonem, Hechonem" as the four sons of "Adalrici ducis vel alio nomine Hettichonis"[28].  m -.  The name of Hugo´
