2 CONT               ***ii)         BERSWINDA .  The Cronica Hohenburgensis records the marriage of "Athicum seu Adalricum" and "Berswindam…filiam sororis sancti Leodegarii, sororem videlicet regina"[511].  The Chronicon Ebersheimense na
2 CONC mes "Berswindam, filiam sororis Leodegarii episcopi…et Garini comitis Pictavensis, sororem videlicet regina" as the wife of Athicus[512].  m ADALRICUS [Athicus], son of LEUDESIUS maior domus & his wife ---.  
