2 CONT ##Cawley, Charles. Medieval Lands: A prosopography of medieval European noble and royal families. Hosted online by the Foundation for Medieval Genealogy (FMG), accessed 2022, Dukes in Alsace. https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ALSAC
