2 CONT
2 CONT Hermesinda Peláez+ b. c 720
2 CONT
2 CONT Don Pelayo and the Reconquista of Spain 
2 CONT
2 CONT BY FELIPE BARANDIARAN
2 CONT
2 CONT Pelayo died from natural causes in Cangas de Onis in 737 and was buried by his wife Gaudiosa near the altar of Our Lady in the Cave of Covadonga.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Rainha das Astúrias
2 CONT --------------------
