2 CONT      Gutierre Osoriz of Galicia was born circa 877. He was the son of Osorio Gutiérrez. Gutierre Osoriz of Galicia married Ildonca Menéndez, daughter of conde Hermenegildo Gutiérrez and Hermesenda Gatónez, before 902. Gutierre Oso
