2 CONC ople/Arnaldo-de-Spoleto-1%C2%BAsenhor-de-Bai%C3%A3o/4179732132180059855 Arnaldo de Espoleto (first lord of Baião, known as D.Arnaldo de Baião)], and of '''D.Ermesenda Eris Fernandes of Lugo/Galicia, Spain''', and great-grandson of
