2 CONC f the 9th century, coming to Portugal with his relatives, from Spain and Italy, to fight the Moors and, due to his bravery, the king of the Kingdom of Leon granted him the lands that are still called Baião e Azevedo, a municipalit
2 CONC y in the District of Porto , Portugal.
