2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho or Waccho (probably Waldchis) was king of the Lombards before they entered Italy from an unknown date (perhaps circa 510) until his death in 539. His father was Unichis. Wacho usurped the throne by assassinating (or having a
2 CONC ssassinated) his uncle, King Tato (again, probably around 510). Tato's son Ildchis fought with him and fled to the Gepids where he died.[1] Wacho had good relations with the Franks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho married three times. His first marriage was to Radigunde, daughter of Bisinus, King of the Thuringi. His second marriage was to Austrigusa, a Gepid possibly named after her maternal descent from Ostrogothic rulers. Austrigus
2 CONC a was the mother of two daughters: Wisigarda (who married Theudebert I of Austrasia) and Waldrada (who married firstly Theudebald of Austrasia, secondly Chlothar I, King of the Franks, and thirdly Garibald I of Bavaria). Wacho's t
2 CONC hird marriage was to Silinga, a Heruli-mother of Waltari.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes   1. ^ Origo Gentis Langobardorum
2 CONT
2 CONT References        * Origo Gentis Langobardorum--------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho or Waccho (probably Waldchis) was king of the Lombards before they entered Italy from an unknown date (perhaps circa 510) until his death in 539. His father was Unichis. Wacho usurped the throne by assassinating (or having a
2 CONC ssassinated) his uncle, King Tato (again, probably around 510). Tato's son Ildchis fought with him and fled to the Gepids where he died.[1] Wacho had good relations with the Franks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho married three times. His first marriage was to Radegund, daughter of Bisinus, King of the Thuringi. His second marriage was to Austrigusa, a Gepid possibly named after her maternal descent from Ostrogothic rulers. Austrigusa
2 CONC  was the mother of two daughters: Wisigarda (who married Theudebert I of Austrasia) and Waldrada (who married firstly Theudebald of Austrasia, secondly Chlothar I, King of the Franks, and thirdly Garibald I of Bavaria). Wacho's th
2 CONC ird marriage was to Silinga, a Heruli-mother of Waltari.
2 CONT
2 CONT A modern descendant is Queen Elizabeth II of the United Kingdom. (not shown in source cited...)
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Roi des Lombards         -------------------Suffix : Kung över langobarderna 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Wacho (Även Waccho) Var DUX ( Duke ) av Langobarderna av 510 till 540
2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho var son till Unichis från huset LithingiHans mor är okänd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wacho var med vid första äktenskap Radegund, (Även Raicunda , Ranicunda ) , dotter till Thüringer kung Fisud (Även Bisinus ), gift .
2 CONT
2 CONT Detta äktenskap var barnlöst
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans andra hustru var med Austrigusa (även Austrigosa ) , ett dotterbolag till Gepid Turisind gift. Denna anslutning kom från döttrarna Wisigard och Waldrada (Även Vuldetrada ) , var båda gifta med frankiska kungar.
2 CONT
2 CONT Från hans tredje äktenskap med Silinga , ett dotterbolag till Herulerkönigs Rudolf Han hade en son Walthari, som blev hans efterträdare.
2 CONT
2 CONT Livet 
2 CONT
2 CONT Om sin barndom och ungdom är inte känd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Under år 510 Wacho mördat sin föregångare och farbror Tato. Hans son var tvungen att fly till Ildichis Gepids och dog där i exil.Därefter utsätts han suavi, I mitten Donau kolonisera Suebi eller en ospecificerad grupp människor vi
2 CONC d floden Spara.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans styre ytterligare fastställts av äktenskapet politiken. Uppdraget , som Frank King Theoderik I. till 531 mellan hans son Theodebert I. och dotter Wacho Wisigard arrangerade serveras till neutralitet langobarderna i kampen för
2 CONC  Konungariket Thüringen att garantera att frankerna efter döden Theoderik den store († 526) inspelningar. Giftermålet ägde rum endast på 537/538 
2 CONT
2 CONT Det engagemang från 540 mellan Theodebert son Theudebald och en andra dotter Wacho , Vuldetrada eller Waldrada tjänade också syftet[5]att säkra alliansen mellan frankerna och langobarderna - kontrakten träff så höga vågor som du a
2 CONC lert även i Bysans till politik Theodebert .
2 CONT
2 CONT Som Wacho dog 540 , var hans son Walthari fortfarande en liten , så Audoin Gause tog över från House of The Regency .
