2 CONT # Note: St. Gondolfus [son of Munderic], Bishop of Tongres, consecrated 599 (brother of Bodegeisel I). He was almost certainly father of Bodegeisel II (gen. 7), not Bodegeisel I as shown in earlier editions. [Ancestral Roots]
