2 CONT
2 CONT ^ The title senior (modern Spanish señor) was preferred in Navarre, whereas in Castile the form dominus (modern Spanish don) was more common.
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ a b c d Canal Sánchez-Pagín, 8–10.
2 CONT
2 CONT ^ a b c d Martín Duque, 899.
