2 CONT **B4. [3m.] Ct Ramon Berenguer II "Cabeza le Estopa" of Barcelona (1076-82), Gerona, Osona, Radez and Carcassonne, *ca 1055, +murdered by his brother at la Perxa de l'Astor 6.12.1082; m.Barcelona before 13.6.1078 Matilda (+Gerona 
2 CONC 19.9.1107/11) dau.of Duke Robert Guiscard of Apulia and Calabria by Sikelgaita de Salerno
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT **B5. [?] Agnes, *ca 1056, +after 1071; m.Dauphine 10.5.1070 Cte Guigues VII d'Albon
2 CONT **B6. [3m.] '''Berenguer Ramon II "el Fratricida" of Barcelona (1076-97) etc, +ca 1097'''
2 CONT **B7. [3m.] Sancha, *1057-59, +after 1079; m. before 1069 Guillaume Ramon I, Cte de Cerdagne et de Berga (+1095)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ramon Berenguer II and Berenguer Ramon II were twins.
