1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#dauRamonBIIIMBernatIIIBesalu
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         --- de Barcelona ([1105/06]-[before 1112]).  The marriage contract of "Raymundus...Barchinonensis comes et marchio...filiam meam prolem Mariæ Ruderici" and “Bernarde Bisuldunensis comes” is dated 1 Oct 1107 and provides
2 CONC  “Ausonensem comitatum” as dowry[408].  Secondary sources usually show this daughter as having married Roger [III] Comte de Foix as her second husband.  For the reasons explained below, it is more likely that Comte Roger´s wife wa
2 CONC s a different daughter, born from her father´s third marriage.  Bofarull suggests that this unnamed daughter must have predeceased her husband, which justified her father taking the county of Besalú on the death of Comte Bernat [I
2 CONC II][409].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 1 Oct 1107) BERNAT [III] Comte de Besalú i Ripoll, son of GUILLÉM [II] "Trunus" Comte de Besalú i Ripoll & his wife Etiennette de Provence (-[1111/12]). 
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT la infanta Maria de Barcelona
2 CONT *https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramon_Berenguer_III#N%C3%BApcies_i_descendents
2 CONT
2 CONT  others wiki think it is the same sister https://www.geni.com/people/Ximena-de-Barcelona-comtesse-d-Osona/6000000005598851255
2 CONT
