2 CONT m ELVIRA, daughter of ---.  Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by a charter dated 17 Sep 1016 under which "Munius Nuniz et uxor mea Sanctia Roderici simul Nepocianus confessus et Hermesinda deouota" donated “in valle Sarria 
2 CONC villa Lusario”, obtained from “domnus Sisnandus episcopus...de susceptione parentum suorum Hermegildus et Paterna et illi habuerunt ea de parentes suos et avios Aloitus et Argilo, Gutier et Geloire”, to “Guttier diaconus et Munie 
2 CONC prolix Munione confesse” at Sobrado[207]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gutierre & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         ALOITO Gutiérrez (-before 5 Jun 963).  His parentage is confirmed by a charter dated 17 Sep 1016 under which "Munius Nuniz et uxor mea Sanctia Roderici simul Nepocianus confessus et Hermesinda deouota" donated “in valle
2 CONC  Sarria villa Lusario”, obtained from “domnus Sisnandus episcopus...de susceptione parentum suorum Hermegildus et Paterna et illi habuerunt ea de parentes suos et avios Aloitus et Argilo, Gutier et Geloire”, to “Guttier diaconus e
2 CONC t Munie prolix Munione confesse” at Sobrado[208].  
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.         OSORIO Gutiérrez .  Conde 899-920. . 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.         HERMENEGILDO Gutiérrez (-after 912).   
2 CONT
2 CONT ----- 
2 CONT
