2 CONT      Gatón, conde del Bierzo was born circa 820. He was the son of Ramiro Iº Bermúdez, rey de Asturias and señora gallega Gontrada (?).1 Gatón, conde del Bierzo married Egilo (?) before 850.1 Gatón, conde del Bierzo died in 866.1
