2 CONC taly in [569][162].  Paulus Diaconus records that King Alboin installed "Gisulfum…suum nepotem" as "ducem…[in] Foroiulanæ civitati"[163].  The Chronicle of Andreas Bergomatis records that Alboin conceded Friuli to "nepoti sui Giso
2 CONC lfi"[164].  The precise relationship between Gisulf and King Alboin is unknown and may have been more remote than implied by "nephew" if the word nepos if translated strictly in these passages.   -         DUKES of FRIULIA. 
