2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his father Merovech as king, traditionally in 457 or 458. With his Frankish warband he was established with his capital at Tournai, on lands which he had received as a foederatus of the Romans, and for some time he ke
2 CONC pt the peace with his allies.
