2 CONT Childeric I was the Merovingian king of the Salian Franks from 457 until his death, and the father of Clovis.
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his father Merovech (Latinized as Meroveus or Merovius) as King, traditionally in 457 or 458. With his Frankish warband he was established with his capital at Tournai, on lands which he had received as a foederatus of
2 CONC  the Romans, and for some time he kept the peace with his allies.
2 CONT
