1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.geni.com/people/M%C3%A9rovech-I-King-of-the-Salian-Franks/6000000002143186115?through=6000000005913253971 MEROVECH] (-[451/57]).  m ---.  The name of Merovech's wife is not known. Merovech is recorded 
