2 CONT The chronicler Fredergar states that he had very loose morals, but does name his 3 queens, of which Ragnetrude is not listed.  Since Fredergar also states it would be impossible to list his concubines and mistresses for the list "
2 CONC being too long", the only one listed by name had to be important enough.
2 CONT
2 CONT It appears that Ragnetrude was the biological mother of Dagobert's oldest child, Sigebert the 3rd.
