2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Genealogy 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/VANDALS,%20SUEVI,%20VISIGOTHS.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         '''MASSILA''' .  m ---.  The name of Massila's wife or concubine is not known.  Massila & his [wife] had two children:
2 CONT **a)         MALDRA (-killed Feb 460).  He succeeded in 456 as MALDRA King of the Suevi in Spain.  Isidor's Historia Gothorum, Wandalorum, Sueborum records that "Maldram Massilæ filium" succeeded as King of the Suevi in Spain afte
2 CONC r the death of Requiario but that he was soon killed[89].  The Chronicon of Bishop Idatius records that “Rechiario” was killed in Dec 456 and that “Rex Theudoricus” succeeded “de Gallæcia ad Lusitaniam” but that the Suevi “in extr
2 CONC ema parte Gallæciæ” installed “Massiliæ filium…Maldram” as their king[90].  The Chronicon of Bishop Idatius records that “Maldras” was murdered in Feb 460[91]. 
2 CONT **b)         son (-killed 459).  The Chronicon of Bishop Idatius records that “Maldras” killed “germanium suum fratrem” in 459 and invaded “Portucale castrum”[92]. 
