2 CONT KING SIEGBERT THE LAME OF COLOGNE (Childebert2, Clovis the Riparian1) of Cologne, son of King Childebert, was born between 399 and 495, and died in 509.
2 CONT
2 CONT Murdered 509 by his own son at the instigation of Clovis I, King of the Salic Franks, 481-511.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child: KING CLODERIC THE PARRICIDE, d. in 509.
