1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Alvaro Perez de Azagra, Senor de Albarazim 
2 CONT * padre:	Pedro Fernandez, Senor de Azagra
2 CONT * madre:	Elsa Ortiz de Coronel
2 CONT * lvaro Perez de Azagra, Senor de Albarazim married '''Margerita de Navarre''', daughter of Thibaut IV, King of Navarre, Count of Champagne, Brie & Bar-sur-Seine. [''Margarita de Navarre, Illegitimate daughter of her father''.]
2 CONT * With an unknown mistress, he had '''Agnes''', who married Álvar Pérez de Azagra, 4th Lord of Albarracín.[a]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===hijos===
2 CONT * Theresa Alvarez de Azagra+
2 CONT * Elsa de Azagra+
