2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NAVARRE.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT King Teobaldo I had four illegitimate children by unknown mistresses: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. '''INES de Navarra''' . Her parentage and marriage are confirmed by a charter dated 15 Jul 1243 under which "D. Alvar Periz" donated the pueblo of Santa Olalla to "mi muger doña Ignis filla del rey de Navarra", confirmed by "D.
2 CONC  Pedro Ferrandez Dazagra vasaillo de Sancta Maria é seinnor de Albarracin"[665]. m (before 15 Jul 1243) as his second wife, ÁLVARO Pérez de Azagra Señor de Albarracín, son of PEDRO Fernández de Azagra & his wife --- 
