2 CONC agon and Navarre.
2 CONT
2 CONT It is believed that she outlived Sancho Ramirez and died in 1123 but some sources say that Sancho Ramirez took a third wife, Philippa of Toulouse. If this is true then it is unknown what happened to Felicia, she may have died or S
2 CONC ancho Ramirez might have divorced her.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the first Queen consort of Aragon to also be Queen consort of Navarre.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her elder son, Alfonso had no children by his marriage to Urraca of León but Ramiro had a daughter, Petronila of Aragon who became the fist women to be Queen of Aragon in her own right.
