1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CATALAN%20NOBILITY.htm#SanchaUrgelMHugoIIAmpurias
2 CONT
2 CONT vi)       SANCHA de Urgell .  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  The tight chronology of the marriages of Armengol [III] and the births of his children Armengol [IV] and Isab
2 CONC el suggest that his younger children must have been born from his second marriage.  A charter dated 5 Oct 1091 records a dispute between the abbots of Sant Pere de Rodes and “sancti Stephani Balneolis cœnobii” in the court of “Ugo
2 CONC ...comes...conjuge mea...Sancia”[2141].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' HUG [II] Comte de Empúries, son of PONCE [I] Comte de Empúries & his wife Adelaida de Besalú (-before 20 Jul 1128). 
