1 NOTE {geni:about_me} solution 1(in-depth studies published citing primary sources) & 3(deduction from primary source?) match now; Indeed not among well sourced [https://www.geni.com/people/Amedeo-II-conte-di-Savoia/6000000000196218118 
2 CONC Amedeo]'s known daughters /!\ 
