2 CONT * Richard A. Fletcher . Saint James's Catapult: The Life and Times of Diego Gelmírez of Santiago de Compostela . Oxford: Oxford University Press, 1984.
2 CONT * Glenn Edward Lipskey. The Chronicle of Alfonso the Emperor: A Translation of the Chronica Adefonsi imperatoris. PhD dissertation, Northwestern University. 1972.
2 CONT * Gonzalo Martínez Díez. "Family origins of Santo Domingo, the lineages of Aza and Guzmán". Santo Domingo de Caleruega, in its socio-political context, 1170–1221 , edd. Cándido Aniz Iriarte and Luis Vicente Díaz Martín. Editorial 
2 CONC San Esteban, 1994, 173–228.
2 CONT * Faustino Menéndez Pidal de Navascués. "The seals of the lords of Molina". Yearbook of Medieval Studies , 14 (1984), 101–119.
2 CONT * Antonio Sánchez de Mora. The Castilian nobility in the middle of the Middle Ages: the lineage of Lara (SS. XI – XIII) . Doctoral Thesis, University of Seville , 2003.
