2 CONC tamente arbet han som den førstefødte grevskapene Barcelona, Tarragona. Manresa, Gerona, Ausona, Peralada. Besalu, Vallespir, Fonollet, Perapertusa, Cerdana, Conflet, Caracasona og Redes. He was a Fyrste between 1137 and 1162 in A
2 CONC ragon. He was a Konge on 11 Aug 1137 in Aragon. (11566) He was engaged in Jun 1137. (11567) He was married to Dronning Petronella RAMIROSDTR av Argon in 1151.(
