2 CONT Charts	Descendants of Charlemage
2 CONT
2 CONT      Urraca Sánchez de Pamplona was born circa 905. She was the daughter of Sancho I Garcés, rey de Pamplona and Urraca Aznárez de Aragón.2,3 Urraca Sánchez de Pamplona married Ramiro II "el Feroz Guerrero", rey de León, son of Or
2 CONC doño II, rey de León and Munia Elvira Menéndez, circa 932; His 2nd.2 Urraca Sánchez de Pamplona died on 23 June 956.3
2 CONT
