2 CONT
2 CONT m '''ADELTRUDA''', daughter of --- "Adelchis Langobardorum gentis princeps" donated property, at the request of "Adeltrud  conjugis nostr ¦", by charter dated Feb 876[221]. She may have been the sister of Count Audoald, as suggest
2 CONC ed by the Chronican Vulturnense which records that "Adelchis Langobardorum gentis Princeps" confirmed the privileges of the abbot of Volturno, at the request of "Audoaldi comitis cognati nostri", by charter dated Feb [878][222] 
2 CONT
