2 CONT ERMENGARDE, daughter of BERNARD Comte [d'Auvergne] & his wife Lieugardis --- (-after 21 Jul 883).  "Bernardus comes et uxor mea Hermengardis" donated property to Conques abbey by charter dated 21 Jul 883[126].  "Princeps et marchi
2 CONC o Willelmus" donated property to the church of Holy Trinity "pro…animæ patris mei Bernardi et matris meæ Ermengardis…" by charter dated Nov 916[127].  Her parents are shown in Europäische Stammtafeln[128] but the primary source on
2 CONC  which this is based has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
