1 NOTE {geni:about_me} --------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''D. Ufa Ufes''' casada com [https://www.geni.com/people/Arnaldo-de-Bai%C3%A3o/6000000003637326569  Arnaldo Eris de Baião], Senhor de Baião, que veio para a Península Ibérica para ajudar a expulsar os mouros.
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ufo_Ufes
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT Casou com '''D. Ufa Ufes''', filha de [https://www.geni.com/people/Hufo-Hufes/6000000011589726214 D. Ufo Ufes] Soeiros Belfaguer (c. 925 -?) e de [https://www.geni.com/people/Teresa-Soares/6000000006591583687 Teresa Soares].
2 CONT ''/!\ Outra informação e que o sogro de Dom Arnaldo foi; Dom Guido Eris e [https://www.geni.com/people/Uzenda-Eris-Gudesindes-de-Lugo/6000000001412937040 Enderquina Palas Arias Mendes] de Coimbra.Esse Guido poderia ser os de; SpoL
2 CONC eto os Guidones - /!\ ''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arnaldo_Eris_de_Bai%C3%A3o
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: ''/!\ {[ already [https://www.geni.com/people/Arnaldo-de-Bai%C3%A3o/6000000003637326569  his] [https://www.geni.com/people/Arnaldo-de-Spoleto-1%C2%BAsenhor-de-Bai%C3%A3o/4179732132180059855 grandfather] wants to be son of  h
2 CONC ttps://www.geni.com/people/imperatore-Guido-III-3-duca-di-Spoleto-re-d-Italia/6000000091252992910 ..there is absolutely a typo: "father-in-law / grandfather" :} /!\ ''
2 CONT
2 CONT >Arnaldo Eris de Baião married to D. Ufa Ufes, daughter of D. Ufo Ufes[2][3] Soeiros Belfaguer (c. 925 -?) and Teresa Soares. Another information is that Dom Arnaldo's father-in-law was; Dom Guido Eris and Enderquina Palas Arias M
2 CONC endes from Coimbra. This Guido could be those of; SpoLeto the Guidones -
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sobre a paternidade de D.Ufa Ufes:
2 CONT
