2 CONT GIRBERT [III] (-after 5 Oct [1048]).  Vicomte [de Carlat].  m NOBILA de Lodève, daughter of HILDUIN Vicomte [de Lodève] & his wife Archimberte - (-after [1060/71])  Girbert & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT >a)         BERNARD [III] (-1050).
2 CONT
2 CONT >b)         '''ADELA (-after [1060/71]).  “Berengarius vicecomes de Cartlato et uxor mea Adila et mater uxoris meæ Nobilis” founded Montsalvy monastery, with the consent of “filii nostri Ricardus, Girbertus, Raimundus”, by charter
2 CONC  dated to [1060/71][763].  Vicomtesse de Carlat.  
2 CONT >m (before 1050) BERENGER [II] Vicomte de Millau et de Gévaudan, son of RICHARD Vicomte de Millau et de Rodez & his wife Rixinde de (-[1080/5 Jan 1097]) “Berengarius vicecomes de Cartlato et uxor mea Adila et mater uxoris meæ Nobi
2 CONC lis” founded Montsalvy monastery, with the consent of “filii nostri Ricardus, Girbertus, Raimundus”, by charter dated to [1060/71][1226].  Bérenger & his wife had three children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>i)          RICHARD ([1050/65]-after 26 Jun 1119)
2 CONT
2 CONT >>ii)         GIRBERT [Gilbert] (-[1110/3 Feb 1112])
2 CONT
2 CONT >>iii)        RAYMOND 
2 CONT
