2 CONC io regi Francorum" and later "Garipald"[88].  Gregory of Tours names "Vuldetrada" as the wife of King Theodebald[89].  Herimannus names "Wanderadam" wife of "Theodpaldus rex Francorum" when recording her second marriage to "Lothar
