2 CONT Ingomer, died young Chlodomer (495–524), King of the Franks at Orléans from 511 Childebert I (496–558), King of the Franks at Paris from 511 Chlothar I (497–561), King of the Franks at Soissons from 511, King of all Franks from 55
2 CONC 8 Clotilde (died 531), married Amalaric, King of the Visigoths
