2 CONT * Mary Dockray-Miller, Motherhood and mothering in Anglo-Saxon England, p.19
2 CONT * Eormenred 1 at Prosopography of Anglo-Saxon England
2 CONT * Wikipedia - https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eormenred_of_Kent
