1 NOTE [FAVthomas.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT    Merovingian Frankish king of Neustria and Burgundy from 639, the sonof Dagobert I. He was dominated successively by Aega and by Erchinoald,Neustrian mayors of the palace.
