1 OCCU Praetoriaanse prefect van Gallie (praefectus praetorio Galliarum), Prefeito Pretoriano da Gália, Tribune of Gaul, Vir Clarissimus, Konsul i Rom, Roman Senator, praetorian prefect of Gaul, Praetorian Prefect of Gaul, ROMAN SENATOR,
