1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Source?''' He left no heirs. The duchy of Alsace was divided into counties after the death of Charlemagne in 814. It was reconstituted after the death of Emperor Henry I in 936 and became hereditary in the von H
2 CONC ohenstauffen family
