2 CONC d in the cartulary of Honau names "Adelbertum, Battichonem, Hugonem, Hechonem" as the four sons of "Adalrici ducis vel alio nomine Hettichonis"[56].  Duke in Alsace.  He is named "ducis Adelberti" in the Annales Murbacenses as fat
2 CONC her of Eberhard[57]. 
