1 NOTE  BIOGRAPHY: Born and died in same city; Aix-la-Chapelle is old name of Aachen. King of Franks, then expanded realm, and was crowned Holy Roman Emperor on Christmas Day 800 in St Peter's Basilica, Rome, by Pope Leo III.
