2 CONT 773 - King of Lombardy.
2 CONT 777 - Defeated the Saxons.
2 CONT 782 - Saxon rebellion.
2 CONT 788 - Overthrew the King of Bohemia.
2 CONT 796 - Subjugated the Avars.
2 CONT 800 - Became the Holy Roman Emperor.
