1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SPANISH%20NOBILITY%20LATER%20MEDIEVAL.htm#AlfonsoAlfonsoMenesesdied1285
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.         ALFONSO Alfonso "Tizao" (-[before 15 Jun 1285]).  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Juan Alonso Tello, D. Alonso Tellez Tizon, D. Martin Alonso Tello, D. Maria Alonso abadesa de Gadafes" as the childre
2 CONC n of "D. Alonso Tellez el viejo" and his second wife "D. Teresa Sanchez"[2195].  A charter dated May 1252 records a peace agreement between "Alfonso Téllez de Meneses" and "su hermano Alonso Alonso de Meneses", both "hijos…de Alfo
2 CONC nso Téllez, el primero de doña Elvira Rodríguez Girón su primera mujer, y el segundo de doña Teresa Sánchez su segunda mujer"[2196].  The monastery of Santa María de Trianos acknowledged receipt of property in "Villamor y Villacal
2 CONC abuey" under the testament of "D M. Alfonso hijo de Alfonso Téllez y Doña Teresa Sánchez" by charter dated 16 Mar 1287[2197].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' MAYOR González Girón, daughter of GONZALO Rodríguez Girón & his second wife Marquesa Pérez (before 1222-).  "Don Gonzalo Roiz maiordomo del rei de Castella…e donna Marquesa mi mulier con los fiios e las fiias que auemos…a 
2 CONC saber Pedro Gonzaluez e Munio Gonzaluez, Nunno Gonzaluz, Maria Gonzaluez, Allionor Gonzaluez, Agnes Gonzaluez, Maior Gonzaluez" ratified donations to the bishopric of Palencia by charter dated 8 May 1222[2198].  The primary source
2 CONC  which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.   
2 CONT
2 CONT  Alfonso & his wife had one child: 
