2 CONT 5.         VASCO Gil de Soverosa .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Vasco Gil, D. Manrique o Enrique Gil, sin hijos, D. Guiomar Gil" as the children of "D. Gil Vazquez de Soverosa" and his second wife "D. Sanch
2 CONC a Gonçalez de Orvaneja"[2662].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' FROILE Fernández, daughter of FERNANDO Yáñez Cheyra & his wife Elvira Méndez.  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Frolle Fernandez, D. Maria Fernandez" as the children of "Fernandeannez Cheyra" and his wif
2 CONC e "D. Elvira Mendez", recording in another passage that "D. Vasco Gil" married "D. Froile"[2663].  The Livro Velho records that "D. Fernão Fernandes" married "D. Sancha Velasques filha de D. Vasco Gil de Souerosa e de D. Froilhe F
2 CONC ernandes"[2664].  Vasco & his wife had three children: 
