2 CONT was a daughter of Duke William IX of Aquitaine and his wife Philippa, Countess of Toulouse. She was an aunt of Eleanor of Aquitaine, Queen consort of France and England. Contents [hide]
2 CONT
2 CONT     * 1 First marriage
