2 CONT # Genealogical History of the Portuguese Royal House, D. António Caetano de Sousa, Atlântida-Livraria Editora, Lda, 2nd Edition, Coimbra, 1946, Volume I-pg. 25.
2 CONT # Descendants of Hermenegildo Guterres who lived between 869 and 911 - Egas Moniz the Aio
