2 CONC phonse was Prince of Capua[523].  Houben speculates that Alphonse must have been about 14 or 15 years old when invested with the principality of Capua, as he was not then old enough to have been knighted with his two older brother
2 CONC s[524].  "Anfusum eius filium [=Rogerium regem Siciliæ" was installed by his father as Prince of Capua in 1136[525].  He was invested as Prince of Capua in Aug 1135, confirmed by Pope Innocent II 25 Jul 1139.  Duke of Naples 1139.
