2 CONT His Reign
2 CONT King of Castile and Toledo
2 CONT Reign	21 August 1157 – 31 August 1158
2 CONT Predecessor	Alfonso VII
2 CONT Successor	Alfonso VIII
2 CONT
2 CONT Vital Stats
