2 CONC lfonso IX of León as her second wife. After their marriage was dissolved on grounds of consanguinity in 1204, she returned to her homeland and became regent of her minor brother King Henry I. Queen of Castile in her own right afte
2 CONC r the death of Henry I in 1214, immediately abdicated in favor of her son. 
