2 CONC  union was unconsummated and dissolved in 1216 on grounds of consanguinity. Soon after his divorce was betrothed with Infanta Sancha of León, eldest daughter of King Alfonso IX and stepdaughter of her oldest sister, but died kille
2 CONC d by a tile coming off a roof before the marriage could be solemnized. 
