2 CONC  de Poitiers ... ("the poems of the first troubadour, Guilhem de Poitiers"). [edit] BibliographyBiographies des troubadours ed. J. Boutière, A.-H. Schutz (Paris: Nizet, 1964) pp. 7-8, 585-587. Bond, Gerald A., ed., transl. intro. 
