2 CONC ke William IX of Aquitaine (Journal of Medieval History), 1993 Meade, Marion. Eleanor of Aquitaine, 1991 Merwin, W.S. Sir Gawain and the Green Knight, 2002. pp xv-xvi. New York: Alfred A. Knopf. ISBN 0-375-41476-2. Owen, D.D.R. El
