2 CONT Son of Raymond Berenger IV of Barcelona Marquis of Barcelona (1113-1162)and Petronilla de Aragón (1135-1173)
2 CONT
2 CONT   b. 4 Apr 1152
2 CONT   b. May 1152, Villa Mayer de Valles, Aragón, Spain
2 CONT   b. Mar 1156/7
2 CONT   d. 25 Apr 1196, Perpignan, Pyrennes-Orientales, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Sancha de Castile Princess de Castile (1154-1208)
2 CONT
