2 CONC  in León and married Countess Aurembiaix of Urgell Ferdinand 	24 March 1188 	4 March 1233 	Lived in France and married Jeanne of Flanders Henry 	1189 	1189 	  Branca 	c. 1192 	1240 	Lady of Guadalajara Berengária 	c. 1195 	1221 	M
