2 CONC  Count of Barcelona, and Countess his wife Dulce de Provence. They were his brothers, among others, Sancho III of Castile and Sancha of Castile and Barcelona, who married Sancho VI the Wise, King of Navarre. He was brother of Sanc
2 CONC ha de Castilla and Poland, who married Alfonso II the Chaste, king of Aragon.
