1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Radelgardo (... - 854 ) was a prince Lombard , prince of Benevento from ' 851 to' 854 . The eldest son of Radelchi I of Benevento and Caretrude, he succeeded his father at the death of these. He was succeeded just three years late
2 CONC r by his brother, Adelchi , because his son, Gaideris , was still very young. Radelgardo also had a daughter, married to Landone III of Capua .
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT - https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radelgardo_di_Benevento
2 CONT
2 CONT - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SOUTHERN%20ITALY,%20PRE-NORMAN.htm#sisGaiderisoMLandoCapua
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         RADELGAR ([822]-[Nov/Dec] [853/54]).  The Annales Beneventani record that "Radelgarius filius Radelchis princeps" succeeded his father in 849 as RADELGAR I Prince of Benevento[197].  The contemporary Epitaphium Radelcar
2 CONC ii Principis names "Radelcarius, Beneventi celsa potestas"[198], arranged in the compilation immediately after the Epitaphium of his supposed mother.  The Chonicon Monasterii Beneventani records the death in 854 of "Radelgarius Pr
2 CONC inceps"[199].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' TASSELGARDA, daughter of ---.  "Radelcharius…Langobardorum gentis princeps" donated property, at the request of "Tasselgardæ…conjugis nostræ", by charter dated Nov 851[200].  Prince Radelgar & his wife had [two] children: 
