2 CONT d)         AIO (824 or after-886).  The Annales Beneventani record "Aio episcopus" in 840 and the death in 886 of "Aio episcopus"[207].  Bishop of Benevento 17 Jul 840.  His parentage is not specified, but the Epitaphium Caretrudæ
2 CONC  records that "coniux Radelchis…hæc Caretruda" was the mother of a bishop[208]. 
