1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT '''Lambert II di Spoleto''' (c880-898), 8th Holy Roman Emperor. He was son of Wido III, king of Italy and emperor. He was Duke of Spoleto and Camerino (891-898), joint King of Italy (892-894), King of Italy (894-898), co-Holy Roma
2 CONC n Emperor (892-894), 8th Holy Roman Emperor (894-898), and Prince of Benevento (895-897). He inherited the crown in 894, and died in a hunting accident in 898, leaving no issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT  Succeeded by  https://www.geni.com/people/Arnulf-Emperor-of-the-West/6000000080002744704
