2 CONC èque de l'Ecole des Chartes, Series 1, Volume II (Paris, 1840–1844). Hummer, Hans J. Politics and Power in Early Medieval Europe: Alsace and the Frankish Realm 600 – 1000. Cambridge University Press: 2005. Flodoard. Historia Remen
