2 CONT Geoffrey Orleans of Gatinais Count of Orleans-76507 [Parents] was born in 825 in Orleans, France. He married Mrs. Mrs. Geoffrey-77627 in 848 in Orleans, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Mrs. Geoffrey-77627 was born about 825. She married Geoffrey Orleans of Gatinais Count of Orleans-76507 in 848 in Orleans, France.
