2 CONT Geoffrey I De 'Count Gatinais' de Orleans 890–942 Birth 890 • Orléans, Loiret, Centre, France Death 942 • Orléans, Loiret, Centre, France
2 CONT
2 CONT When Geoffrey I De 'Count Gatinais' de Orleans was born in 890 in Orléans, Loiret, France, his father, Aubri, was 35. He had one daughter with Ava of Auvergne in 916. He died in 942 in his hometown at the age of 52.
2 CONT
