2 CONT Rudolph I, Roi de Jurane Bourgogne was the son of Conrad II, Comte d'Auxerre and Waldrada (?). (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 25 October 912.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rudolph I, Roi de Jurane Bourgogne was a member of the House of Guelph.1 He gained the title of Roi Rudolph I de Jurane Bourgogne in 888.1
