2 CONT 2.         '''ADELA''' .  A manuscript genealogy, dated to the early 12th century, records "Letaldus comes Vesoncius et Umbertus comes Marisconensis fratres", adding "ex Umberto, Adala comitissa"[1288].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Adela's husband is not known.  Adela & her husband had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         WANDALMODIS .  A manuscript genealogy, dated to the early 12th century, records "Letaldus comes Vesoncius et Umbertus comes Marisconensis fratres", adding "ex Umberto, Adala comitissa, ex Adala Windesmodis soror matris
2 CONC  vestræ non germana, ex Windesmode Ingelbertus et Witdo de Upione"[1289]. <br>  '''m''' as his first wife, ENGELBERT [II] de Brienne, son of [ENGELBERT [I] Comte [de Brienne] & his wife ---] (-1008 or after). 
