1 CONT
1 CONT     OCCU Count of Hasbaye ...
1 CONT     SOUR Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p 37 says CIR 700;
1 CONT     www.public.asu.edu/bgertz/family/d0000 says ABT 700;
1 CONT     al7fl.abts.net/green-page/greenged.html says ABT 670, France;
1 CONT     SOUR COMYNI.GED (Compuserve), #1560 says ABT 715
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 37 says living 750
1 CONT     Count in Hasbaye. This could have been Lambert of Hasbaye who was
1 CONT     observed (occ.) 706-715 - al7fl.abts.net/green-page/greenged.html;
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: Count Of Hesbaye LAMBERT b: 665 in Bourgogne, France
