1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Williswinde b: ABT 700 in France
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Has Children Sigramine DE HASBAYE b: ABT 702 in Hasbaigne, France
1 CONT    2. Has Children Count Of Thurgovie GUERIN b: ABT 725
