1 CONT Hlawitschka's "Die Vorfahren Karls des Grossen", in _Karl der Grosse_
1 CONT (1965).
1 CONT
1 CONT Weis' "Ancestral Roots" (line 240) has a Merovingian descent from King
1 CONT Dagobert II to most of Europe's royal houses, reading for the first two
1 CONT generations as follows:
1 CONT LINE 240:
1 CONT 10. DAGOBERT II, King of Austrasia 678-680. (Generations 1-10
1 CONT (questionable and omitted): Larousse Hist. de France I 49)
1 CONT 11. ADELA, accepted by Eckhardt as dau. of Dagobert II, but
1 CONT believed by Hlawitscha to be dau. of Hugobert and Irma, mother of Aubri
1 CONT I, Count of Blois. (Identification of Adela's parents depends on a forged
1 CONT charter.)
1 CONT
1 CONT -SSMD
