0 @N6000000002248121279@ NOTE Abbess and Saint
1 CONT
1 CONT Daughter of Saint Dagobert II, King of the Franks, and the Anglo-Saxon princess Matilda. Sister of Saint Irmina.
1 CONT Grand-daughter of Saint Sigebert, King of Austrasia. Princess. Married to Alberic. Mother of one son. Widowed. Her wealth, position, and beauty brought her many suitors, but she became a nun. Founded the convent of Palatiolum of
1 CONT Pfalsel near Trier in 690. Abbess.
1 CONT
1 CONT _____________________________________-
