1 CONT
1 CONT     [daveanthes.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT     OCCU Duke of Alsace ...
1 CONT     SOUR members.aol.com/sargen3
1 CONT     SOUR members.aol.com/sargen3 says 690, France;
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 150 says c690;
1 CONT     COMYNI.GED (Compuserve), #1607 says 20 Feb 690;
1 CONT     SOUR COMYN4.TAF (Compuserve), p. 13;
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 150, 164;
1 CONT     ANJOU.TXT (Compuserve);
1 CONT     ETICHO I, son of LEUDEFREDUS II and ?: [EXCERPTED FROM: G.A. Moriarty's PLANTAGENET ANCESTRY; all material in double- quotes is a direct quote from him.]
1 CONT     "The early history of the House of Eticho is very obscure and in great
1 CONT     confusion. The books give a long pedigree from Eticho I, D. of Alsace, who
1 CONT     lived about 675-700 and married Berswinde, dau of the Merovingian King
1 CONT     Sisiberth (b. 631; d. 656), the son of King Dagobert (d. 639?), but they
1 CONT     offer no valid proof. Count Hugh le Mefiant of Tours (d. 836), the trusted
1 CONT     official of Charlemagne, undoubtedly belonged to this family, and Abbe
1 CONT     Achaume suggests that he may have been a son of a Hugh, who was "princeps" in
1 CONT     Burgundy, and who married Bertha, daughter of a Count Guibert and Ada (VITA
1 CONT     HILTRUDIS), and he may be the Hugh who in 785 made a gift to Fulda for the
1 CONT     soul of his son, Hohiconi [?] (Schannat's "Traditiones Fuldenses," no. 15).
1 CONT     If this is so the elder Hugh _may_ have been a brother of Luitfrid II, C. of
1 CONT     Upper Alsace, who died in 802. (Chaume's ORIGINES, vol. I, p.424)."
1 CONT     -ANJOU.TXT (Compuserve)
1 CONT     Adalric; head of the House of Ethiconides - Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W.
1 CONT     Stuart, p. 164
1 CONT
1 CONT     OCCU Duke of Alsace ...
1 CONT     SOUR members.aol.com/sargen3
1 CONT     SOUR members.aol.com/sargen3 says 690, France;
1 CONT     Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 150 says c690;
1 CONT     COMYNI.GED (Compuserve), #1607 says 20 Feb 690;
1 CONT     SOUR COMYN4.TAF (Compuserve), p. 13;
