1 CONC  trying to retake Bureba and Alta Rioja, which his father had given away to king of Navarre and failed to retake. The Navarrese Sancho begged the aid of the Aragonese Sancho to defend his kingdom. Sancho of Castile defeated the tw
1 CONC o cousins and retook both Bureba and Alta Rioja, as well as Álava.
