0 @N6000000001355773583@ NOTE Vicomte of Gievaudun, Milhaud, Carlat and Rodeve. Berenger was present 29 Feb 1051, when Hugh de Roverge, Comte de Roverge, and his motherthe Contesse Richarde, made a gift to Conquer Abbey. He was named ina letter of Pope Gregory
1 CONC  VII, dated 12 Apr 1080, complaining that he had refused the homage which he owed to the Abbey of Curillac.
