1 CONT Brunhild, retrieved 17 September 2005. 
1 CONT Nicolas and Paul Chalmin, "L'Etrange Histoire de la Chaussée Brunehaut", Nordmag, Calais: 2004, retrieved 19 February 2005. 
1 CONT Ian Wood, The Merovingian Kingdoms, 1994. 
1 CONT Hodgkin, Thomas. Italy and her Invaders. Clarendon Press, 1895. 
1 CONT This article incorporates text from the Encyclopædia Britannica Eleventh Edition, a publication now in the public domain. 
