0 @N6000000003637361891@ NOTE
1 CONT http://libro.uca.edu/urraca/urraca7.htm
1 CONT In the earlier period, one Muño Gutiérrez served as majordomo between July 1109 and September 1110. It is not possible to identify him further.
1 CONT
1 CONT 25. A document of Burgos dated February 28, 1112 mentions him as majordomo, but it is a thirteenth-century copy and the original may have read "merinus." See AHN, Clero, carp. 378, no. 1. For a similar reference in a charter of Ap
1 CONC ril 13, 1121, see ch. 5, note 7.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://libro.uca.edu/urraca/urraca2.htm
1 CONT ...and Muño Gutiérrez, the queen's majordomo.(42)
1 CONT 42. The charter does not survive in the original. AC León, no. 1.002, a very early copy, bears the original confirmation of Alfonso VII datable to March of 1126. See Bernard F. Reilly, "The Chancery of Alfonso VII of León-Castilla
1 CONC : The Period 1116-1135 Reconsidered," Speculum 51 (1976):249 and n. 39. Other, later copies are in AC León, no. 1.003, and Tumbo, fol. 95; published in Manuel Risco, ES, vols. 28-42 (Madrid, 1774-1801), 36:94-96 app., and in Tomás
1 CONC  Muñoz y Romero ed., Colección de fueros municipales y cartas pueblas (Madrid, 1847), pp. 99-101. Archbishop Maurice of Braga may have confirmed ac this time, but the copyist was unsure how to place his name, which indicates that 
1 CONC he might have confirmed it later.
1 CONT
1 CONT http://libro.uca.edu/urraca/urraca5.htm
1 CONT by Muño Gutiérrez as majordomo, who is known to have held that post in 1109 and 1110.
0 @N6000000003637361122@ NOTE Rodrigo Froilaz o Manido Gutiérrez, "Rodericus Froyle habuit tres filios: Menendum Roderici et Gundisaluum Roderici et Froylam Roderici. De Menendo Roderici natus est Suerios Menendi, qui dictus est Zapata, et iste dedit totam her
1 CONC editatem suma quam habebat in Aranga et in Galletia Sancte Marie Superaddi. De Gundisaluo Roderici natus est Fernandus Fundisalui et Elvira Gundisalui et Gundisaluu Gundisalui. Iste dederunt totam hereditatem suma quam habebant in
1 CONC  Galletia Sancte Marie Superaddi". Cuyo hermano fue el conde Pelayo Gutierrez....Rodrigo casó con la condesa Doña Elvira y se halló en la batalla de Aguademaias.
