1 CONC was crowned by Gelmrez in 1111, and his reign in Galicia began effectively -- despite Urraca's intermittent but active opposition--in 1116. Urraca's death in 1126 ended a disastrous episode in the medieval political history of Chr
1 CONC istian Spain. [Encyclopaedia Britannica CD '97]
