1 CONT (Andre Castelot, Histoire de La France, Tome 1, Pages 247 - 248, 256).
1 CONT AKA: Clovis II, King de Neustrie. Born: in 634, son of Dagobert I, King d'Austrasie and Nantechild.
1 CONT Occupation: between 639 and 657 Second son of Dagobert I, Clovis II was King of Neustrie and of Bourgogne from 639 to 657.
