1 CONT ^ Daly, William M. Daly, "Clovis: How Barbaric, How Pagan?" Speculum 69.3 (July 1994:619-664) 
1 CONT ^ Edward James, Gregory of Tours Life of the Fathers (Liverpool: Liverpool University Press, 1985), p. 155 n. 12. 
1 CONT ^ The abbey was demolished in 1802. All that remains is the Tour Clovis, a Romanesque tower which now lies within the grounds of the Lycée Henri IV, just east of The Panthéon. 
1 CONT ^ "The Rise of the Carolingians or the Decline of the Merovingians?" (pdf) 
1 CONT
